    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B02a scope (tenant core & config)","items":["Modules: tenant, tenant-allowed-origin, tenant-frontend-config, tenant-storage-config (~34 routes est.). B02 split into B02a/B02b/B02c; tenant-idp-config excluded (in B01).","Admin tenant: /admin/tenants lifecycle/admin endpoints including usage, suspend/archive/restore, tags, reference-set sync, provisioning controllers (base CRUD may be via shared/decorator patterns; verify full route list in catalog/OpenAPI).","Self tenant: GET /tenants/me, GET/PATCH /tenants/me/config. Allowed origins: posture + CRUD (6). Config: tenant frontend config GET/PUT; tenant storage config tenant/platform/effective CRUD paths."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Tenant lifecycle: POST /admin/tenants/:id/suspend|archive|restore -> tenant/status response; PUT/GET tags manage tenant tags.","My tenant config: PATCH /tenants/me/config with config DTO -> updated config.","Allowed origin create: POST /admin/allowed-origins with origin DTO -> origin record; posture reports enforcement state.","Storage config: PUT /admin/tenants/storage/config or platform path with backend config DTO -> effective/config response. Verify DTO schemas and sensitive field handling."]},
